# Private subscriptions and runtime data
data/
**/data/
**/settings.json
**/user_nodes.json
**/nodes.yaml
**/config.yaml
**/mihomo.log
*.log
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# Build tools, private packaging input, executable releases
/build/*
!/build/TSearchDS.spec
!/build/build-public.ps1
/dist/
/release/
/run/
**/run/
/docs/source-probes/
/docs/*.png
/docs/*report*.txt
/docs/smoke*.txt

/src/resources/mihomo.exe

# Rust / Tauri build output (tauri/src-tauri/target can exceed 1 GB)
/tauri/src-tauri/target/
/tauri/node_modules/
# tauri/src-tauri/gen/schemas is intentionally tracked: it is small and gives
# editors autocomplete for tauri.conf.json.
